AAAC-WvOWw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/labels/type:feature","name":"type:feature","color":"a2eeef","default":false,"description":"new behavior","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12774527217,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7DWbs8AAAAC-WvQ8Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/labels/status:waiting-release","name":"status:waiting-release","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"accepted, waiting for live publication at a run boundary","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12774527382,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7DWbs8AAAAC-WvRlg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/labels/area:v6-card-pick","name":"area:v6-card-pick","color":"bfd4f2","default":false,"description":"V6 reward card pick","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-10-21T03:16:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:55:22Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T00:55:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 目标（Roy 2026-10-21 再次改定）\n\n大脑文字策略库的基础设施（`docs/v6-plan.md` 第 13 节步骤 3）。拿牌继续由大脑决定，**不再做 Jev 拿牌**；原“Jev 学大脑拿牌”三期计划停止（留档见文末）。\n\n策略条目是“情境 → 策略”的文字，每条带触发条件、策略文字、证据、来源（`own` / `external:<名>`）和可信度。内容由学习者写（#27），本 issue 只做数据、格式和检索。\n\n## 要做\n\n1. **大脑决策数据集**（已在做的部分保留）：大脑每道战后拿牌题，以及事件、休息、商店、幕初计划，记录题面要点、牌组、选项、大脑的选择与理由，再连上之后的结果：本幕剩余掉血、是否过本幕 Boss、终层。只用 Silent，每条带局号与楼层。供学习者找出“稳定的习惯”和“之后结果明显更差的选择”。\n2. **条目格式**：定 schema（触发条件用可机器匹配的字段：幕、楼层段、Boss、血量段、牌组特征、题型；外加策略文字、证据、来源、可信度、版本），存放位置与现有经验库（`knowledge/characters/silent/experience.json`）的关系写清楚：是扩展现有格式还是新文件。\n3. **检索**：拼大脑题面时，按触发条件选出最相关的几条（有条数和长度上限），放进题面；没有命中就不放。\n4. 固定数据测试：匹配正确、上限生效、没命中时题面不变。\n\n## 验收\n\n- [x] 数据集报告：题数、局数、按题型和版本的覆盖，缺失口径\n- [x] schema 与检索实现、固定测试；tsc 与完整 vitest 通过\n- [x] 用几条示例条目做固定回放：5 种题型的题面正确带上条目，报题面字节数与准备耗时\n\n## 负责人与边界\n\nowner:dev。不写游戏知识条目（学习者做），不改 live/STOP，不运行 play；上线交集成员和 ops。对局在跑：nice 19，最多 4 个进程。\n\n## 已停止的计划（留档）\n\n- 2026-10-21 第二版“Jev 学大脑拿牌”三期（离线一致率 → 在线影子 → 接管 A/B）：随方向调整停止。\n- 第一版“混合门”：被 #12 否定（只有 0.7% 的题能分辨）。\n","closed_by":{"login":"dwroy","id":1374130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzQxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1374130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy","html_url":"https://github.com/dwroy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/16/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/16/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}
